  "description": "<strong>Tickets for Gourmaze: An Asian Street Food Treasure Hunt in London</strong><br>\r\n🎫 Gourmaze Ticket for 1, includes an action-packed tour and 3 mystery dishes<br>\r\n<em>For more than 2&nbsp;players, dividing into competing teams can add an extra dimension to the maze!</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🚶 Escape room meets food walking tour in this unique adventure across the city!<br>\r\n✨ Solve riddles sent to your phone to uncover hidden food gems&nbsp;<br>\r\n🍜 Enjoy a selection of 3 Asian street food dishes that will bring your palate to life&nbsp;<br>\r\n🌱 Vegetarian and vegan options are also available&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date and times:&nbsp;<br>\r\nTuesday to Saturday: 12 PM - 5:30 PM<br>\r\nSunday: 12 PM - 3:30 PM<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours&nbsp;<br>\r\n📍 Location: to be revealed!<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: all ages welcome however under 16s must be supervised by an adult&nbsp;<br>\r\n❓ Please note: you must have a mobile phone with data and access to Whatsapp in order to play the game&nbsp;<br>\r\n📱 <strong>Please see your Fever confirmation email for all essential post-purchase information as you must email Gourmaze 48h prior to the event to receive the game launch link</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nAre you ready for a gourmet adventure unlike any other? Introducing <em>Gourmaze</em>, the perfect cross between an escape room and a food walking tour. This exciting experience is your chance to explore London's hidden food gems while solving a series of riddles sent straight to your phone.&nbsp;Confucius has scattered three Talisman treats across Soho for you to find. These are foods from all over Asia that help to heal the mind, body, and soul. Follow the trail, find the Talismans, and unlock the golden rule! Get your tickets now for <em>Gourmaze: An Asian Street Food Treasure Hunt</em>&nbsp;in London!",
